Recommends: hyprland-guiutils, libpam-gnome-keyring, pcmanfm-qt, xwayland
Description: Lugh desktop session
 The Wayland session of Lugh OS: the lugh-session launcher and its entry in
 /usr/share/wayland-sessions, the Lugh configuration of the Hyprland
 compositor (/usr/share/lugh/hypr: look, animations, rules, keybindings,
 helper scripts) and the xdg-desktop-portal backend selection.
 .
 Hyprland comes from trixie-backports.
